{"id":"n50309-1-9","stage":3,"title":"만남 · 相会","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50309-1-9-1","ko":"지난주에 너 남자 소개받았다면서? 어떻게 됐어?","zh":"上周你不是说有人给你介绍对象了吗？后来怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난주에","meaning":"上周","explanation":"지난주：上周；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난주","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58105","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난주에","audio":"/audio/097f9497254585f42cc5.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男人","explanation":"남자：男人","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"소개받았다면서?","meaning":"介绍；接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"소개：介绍；받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"소개","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3"},{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64301","senseId":"2","lemma":"소개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소개받았다면서","audio":"/audio/e5a4ae696f4449d1f831.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"됐어?","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐어","audio":"/audio/9b5be22a79f473c72762.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7d3f1e161caf0a72","term":"지난주","zh":"上周","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3","entryId":"58105","definition":"本周的前一周。","pronunciation":["지난주"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"一个女人的丈夫或恋人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"7367283c48b6e4d5","term":"소개","zh":"介绍","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3","entryId":"64301","definition":"在互不认识的人之间建立联系，使双方相识来往。","pronunciation":["소개"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/abab2470dce9f8dcb74e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50309-1-9-2","ko":"그 사람이랑 나, 운명적인 만남인 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得我和那个人是命中注定的相遇。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이랑","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이랑","audio":"/audio/b5b523b6ae9cd906c401.mp3"}},{"text":"나,","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"운명적인","meaning":"命运的，命里注定的","explanation":"운명적：命运的，命里注定的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"운명적","audio":"/audio/c69327199ef642e728f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68816","senseId":"1","lemma":"운명적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운명적인","audio":"/audio/81e1b7f2a2209c455dd7.mp3"}},{"text":"만남인","meaning":"相会，见面","explanation":"만남：相会，见面；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만남","audio":"/audio/cc284f72e127653a5be1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50309","senseId":"1","lemma":"만남","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만남인","audio":"/audio/7cffe5f7fc03e7bbec8e.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c69327199ef642e7","term":"운명적","zh":"命运的，命里注定的","audio":"/audio/c69327199ef642e728f2.mp3","entryId":"68816","definition":"命运已经定好的。","pronunciation":["운ː명적"]},{"id":"cc284f72e127653a","term":"만남","zh":"相会，见面","audio":"/audio/cc284f72e127653a5be1.mp3","entryId":"50309","definition":"彼此相见。","pronunciation":["만남"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/507fcf4fda96ab5c8950.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.717,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=50309","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得我和那个人是命中注定的相遇。","上周你不是说有人给你介绍对象了吗？后来怎么样了？","你脸上怎么有淤青啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["上周你不是说有人给你介绍对象了吗？后来怎么样了？","你脸上怎么有淤青啊？","我觉得我和那个人是命中注定的相遇。"],"answer":2}]}
